ic, dense music with multiple nuances. \"Hola somos Radio Futura y queremos presentar a un grupo este evento dentro del panorama musical español. Se llaman décima víctima y hacen una música completamente auténtica, densa y como múltiples matricios.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"La España Siniestra ｜ La edad de oro del Postpunk y el Dark wave","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VN_buvQC69c"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":178264127080763,"type":"album","name":"Música moderna","list_id":263518308207240,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Movida madrileña","src":"musthear","rank":25,"year":1980,"note":null,"yt":"pM1_TIpqLe4","scaruffi":null},{"id":108807811621699,"type":"album","name":"La ley del desierto, la ley del mar","list_id":229331613223811,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — New Wave","src":"musthear","rank":158,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"pM1_TIpqLe4","scaruffi":null},{"id":108807811621699,"type":"album","name":"La ley del desierto, la ley del mar","list_id":263518308207240,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Movida madrileña","src":"musthear","rank":7,"year":1984,"note":null,"yt":"pM1_TIpqLe4","scaruffi":null},{"id":236418980878389,"type":"album","name":"De un país en llamas","list_id":229331613223811,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — New Wave","src":"musthear","rank":171,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"75lpAiAbwEE","scaruffi":null},{"id":236418980878389,"type":"album","name":"De un país en llamas","list_id":263518308207240,"list":"RYM Top — Scenes & Movements — Movida madrileña","src":"musthear","rank":3,"year":1985,"note":null,"yt":"75lpAiAbwEE","scaruffi":null},{"id":718648434241,"type":"song","name":"El tonto Simón","work_year":1986,"list_id":119989900341496,"list":"Los 40 nº1 · 1986","src":"singles","rank":11,"year":1986,"note":"","yt":"chWmKSLEpAA","scaruffi":null},{"id":233422587034401,"type":"song","name":"37 grados","work_year":1987,"list_id":106747873626202,"list":"Los 40 nº1 · 1987","src":"s